VEHXQ7AS"}, "file_filesize" : " (15.12MB)", "file_order" : 3, "file_is_remote" : 0, "file_num_download" : 0, "download_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/content/scomber/scomber_-_Outrun_this_Blur.flac", "local_path" : "/var/www/ccmixter/content/scomber/scomber_-_Outrun_this_Blur.flac", "file_rawsize" : 15850385}], "upload_description_plain" : "Here's the first song from a recent songwriting session with the \"all grown up now\" Scomberella.\r\n\r\nHere's Maddie getting her country on and belting it out in a 6/8 time shuffle on the guitar. \r\n\r\nIve uploaded the pella separately here .\r\nThe guitar , drums and the fake accordian are uploaded  here as stems.\r\n\r\n\r\n\"Outrun this Blur\"\r\n\r\nThe light peeks through the blinds\r\nits a sunny day outside\r\nim leaving your life\r\nwhile I contemplate mine\r\n\r\nReach out for your hand\r\nbut all I grasp is air\r\nbut im too tired \r\nto even cry\r\n\r\nOh my heart feels like a ten ton weight pulling me down to earth\r\nyou took advantage of an impath\r\njust shows me what your worth\r\na deep hunger for that great love\r\neven though it hurts\r\nBut I'm too numb \r\nto outrun this blur\r\n\r\nJigsaw heart lost piece\r\nHow will I be complete?\r\nLost in the woods\r\nsearching for crumbs of who I am without you\r\n\r\nOh my heart feels like a ten ton weight pulling me down to earth\r\nyou took advantage of an impath\r\njust shows me what your worth\r\na deep hunger for that great love\r\neven though it hurts\r\nBut I'm too numb \r\nto outrun this blur\r\n\r\nYou were a puppet master \r\nalways pulling strings\r\nand these scars\r\nyeah they still bleed\r\nThe lonliness engulfs me\r\ndrowning in its stream\r\nBut you took everything but the air I breath\r\nGhost of our memories past haunt my dreams\r\nbut I cant erase time without forgetting what made me\r\nmust be my fairy tales \r\njust make believe\r\nthe sad reality \r\nnow your begging on your knees!\r\n\r\nOh my heart feels like a ten ton weight pulliung me down to earth\r\nyou took advantage of an impath\r\njust shows me what your worth\r\na deep hunger for that great love\r\neven though it hurts\r\nBut I'm too numb \r\nto outrun this blur\r\n\r\nScOmBeR x 2026", "upload_description_html" : "Here&#8217;s the first song from a recent songwriting session with the &#8220;all grown up now&#8221; Scomberella.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere&#8217;s Maddie getting her country on and belting it out in a 6/8 time shuffle on the guitar. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIve uploaded the pella separately  <a title=\"https://ccmixter.org/files/scomber/71240\" class=\"cc_format_link\" href=\"https://ccmixter.org/files/scomber/71240\">here</a> .<br />\r\nThe guitar , drums and the fake accordian are uploaded  here as stems.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"b\">&#8220;Outrun this Blur&#8221;</span></span><span class=\"b\"></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe light peeks through the blinds<br />\r\nits a sunny day outside<br />\r\nim leaving your life<br />\r\nwhile I contemplate mine<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReach out for your hand<br />\r\nbut all I grasp is air<br />\r\nbut im too tired <br />\r\nto even cry<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOh my heart feels like a ten ton weight pulling me down to earth<br />\r\nyou took advantage of an impath<br />\r\njust shows me what your worth<br />\r\na deep hunger for that great love<br />\r\neven though it hurts<br />\r\nBut I&#8217;m too numb <br />\r\nto outrun this blur<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJigsaw heart lost piece<br />\r\nHow will I be complete?<br />\r\nLost in the woods<br />\r\nsearching for crumbs of who I am without you<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOh my heart feels like a ten ton weight pulling me down to earth<br />\r\nyou took advantage of an impath<br />\r\njust shows me what your worth<br />\r\na deep hunger for that great love<br />\r\neven though it hurts<br />\r\nBut I&#8217;m too numb <br />\r\nto outrun this blur<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou were a puppet master <br />\r\nalways pulling strings<br />\r\nand these scars<br />\r\nyeah they still bleed<br />\r\nThe lonliness engulfs me<br />\r\ndrowning in its stream<br />\r\nBut you took everything but the air I breath<br />\r\nGhost of our memories past haunt my dreams<br />\r\nbut I cant erase time without forgetting what made me<br />\r\nmust be my fairy tales <br />\r\njust make believe<br />\r\nthe sad reality <br />\r\nnow your begging on your knees!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOh my heart feels like a ten ton weight pulliung me down to earth<br />\r\nyou took advantage of an impath<br />\r\njust shows me what your worth<br />\r\na deep hunger for that great love<br />\r\neven though it hurts<br />\r\nBut I&#8217;m too numb <br />\r\nto outrun this blur<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScOmBeR x 2026"}]